      "summary_html": "<p>Eleven days after his resignation, Jensen Huang is back as Nvidia CEO with White House backing. Nvidia\u2019s board cited input from senior U.S. officials on national security, and the news sent markets soaring. Has America\u2019s AI strategy become so dependent on one CEO that he\u2019s too big to fire?</p><p><strong>New Episode: How Anthropic Went from AI Safety Outcast to World's Most Important Company</strong></p><p>Spotify: <a href=\"https://open.spotify.com/episode/1MJpqbn3HWleuU9fUoeCX7\">https://open.spotify.com/episode/1MJpqbn3HWleuU9fUoeCX7</a><br/>Apple: <a href=\"https://podcasts.apple.com/us/podcast/how-anthropic-went-from-ai-safety-outcast-to-the/id6822359990?i=1000803569349\">https://podcasts.apple.com/us/podcast/how-anthropic-went-from-ai-safety-outcast-to-the/id6822359990?i=1000803569349</a></p><p><br/></p><p><strong>Brought to you by:</strong></p><p><strong>KPMG</strong> \u2013 New KPMG and UT Austin research shows what separates \u201cAI Amplifiers\u201d from everyone else. Learn more at <a href=\"https://kpmg.com/us/en/articles/2026/ai-redefining-career-success-empower-your-talent-thrive.html?utm_source=the_ai_daily_brief&amp;utm_medium=native&amp;utm_content=podcast&amp;utm_campaign=701dV00000aMKrPQAW&amp;cid=701dV00000aMKrPQAW\">\u2060\u2060\u2060\u2060\u2060\u2060\u2060\u2060\u2060\u2060\u2060\u2060\u2060\u2060\u2060\u2060\u2060\u2060\u2060\u2060\u2060\u2060\u2060\u2060\u2060\u2060\u2060\u2060kpmg.com/us/AIamplifiers\u2060\u2060\u2060\u2060\u2060\u2060\u2060\u2060\u2060\u2060\u2060\u2060\u2060\u2060\u2060\u2060\u2060\u2060\u2060\u2060\u2060\u2060\u2060\u2060\u2060\u2060\u2060\u2060</a></p><p><strong>Gartner</strong> - AI strategy, trends and insights - <a href=\"https://www.gartner.com/ai\">\u2060\u2060\u2060\u2060\u2060\u2060https://www.gartner.com/ai\u2060\u2060\u2060\u2060\u2060\u2060</a></p><p><strong>Granola</strong> - The AI notepad for people in back-to-back meetings. Try it free <a href=\"http://granola.ai/bri